<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>服务暂不可用 | Service Unavailable</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><style>        * {      margin: 0;      padding: 0;      box-sizing: border-box;    }    body {      height: 100vh;      display: flex;      justify-content: center;      align-items: center;      background: #f5f7fa;      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,                   "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif;      color: #333;    }        .card {      max-width: 420px;      padding: 2rem 3rem;      background: #fff;      border-radius: 12px;      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);      text-align: center;    }    .card h1 {      font-size: 1.5rem;      margin-bottom: 1rem;    }    .card p {      font-size: 1rem;      line-height: 1.6;    }    .divider {      width: 60%;      height: 1px;      margin: 1.5rem auto;      background: #e5e7eb;      border: none;    }</style></head><body><div class="card"><h1>服务暂不可用</h1><p>抱歉，您所在的国家我们暂未开展业务，无法为您提供服务。</p><hr class="divider"><h1>Service Unavailable</h1><p>Sorry, our services are not available in your country at the moment.</p></div></body></html>